## 2. Project structure

```
agent_backend/              # FastAPI backend + core logic
  api.py                    # FastAPI app -- the one endpoint the frontend calls
  rag.py                    # RAG chain (Pinecone retrieval + LLM)
  booking.py                # Appointment extraction + Gmail confirmation
  ingest_pdf.py              # One-time script: PDF -> chunks -> Pinecone
  query_hospital.py          # CLI tool for testing retrieval without voice
  jarvis_voice.py            # Terminal voice-mode helpers (STT/TTS/wake word)
  main.py                    # Terminal voice-mode entry point (optional, not used by the web app)
  gradio_app.py               # Gradio browser demo (optional alternative frontend)
  .env                        # API keys (create this -- see section 3)

jarvis-frontend/            # Vite + React (JS) + Tailwind + RTK Query
  src/
    main.jsx                 # Entry point -- wraps <App/> in Redux <Provider>
    App.jsx                  # Landing <-> JarvisInterface toggle
    store.js                  # Redux store
    api/jarvisApi.js          # RTK Query slice -- calls the backend
    pages/Landing.jsx
    pages/JarvisInterface.jsx
    utils/wavRecorder.js      # Browser mic -> real WAV (no ffmpeg needed)
  .env                        # VITE_API_BASE_URL -- see section 3
```

