## 3. Environment variables

### Backend `.env` (in `agent_backend/`)

```
HUGGINGFACEHUB_API_TOKEN=hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
PINECONE_API_KEY=pcsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GMAIL_ADDRESS=your.email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
PATIENT_NAME=Your Name
PATIENT_EMAIL=your.email@example.com
PYTHON_VERSION=3.11.15 // add this for render
```

- `PATIENT_NAME` / `PATIENT_EMAIL`: this is a personal single-user assistant, so these are fixed rather than asked for during booking.
- `GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD` must be an **App Password**, not your regular Gmail password -- Google blocks plain SMTP login otherwise.

### Frontend `.env` (in `jarvis-frontend/`, project root -- same level as `package.json`)

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
```

Change this to your deployed backend URL once hosted (see section 6).

