## 5. Frontend setup (local)

```bash
npm create vite@latest jarvis-frontend -- --template react
cd jarvis-frontend
npm install @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
```

Drop in the project files (`main.jsx`, `App.jsx`, `store.js`, `api/jarvisApi.js`, `pages/Landing.jsx`, `pages/JarvisInterface.jsx`, `utils/wavRecorder.js`) matching the structure in section 2.

Confirm `tailwind.config.js` includes:
```js
export default {
  content: ["./index.html", "./src/**/*.{js,jsx}"],
  theme: { extend: {} },
  plugins: [],
}
```

And `src/index.css` has:
```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### Run the frontend

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open the printed local URL (usually `http://localhost:5173`). You should see the JARVIS landing page.

