## 7. Common issues

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `ImportError: DLL load failed ... Application Control policy` | Windows Smart App Control blocking a native dependency | Turn off Smart App Control (Settings -> Privacy & security -> Windows Security -> App & browser control) |
| `model_not_supported` from HF router | Model needs an explicit provider suffix | Use `"Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct:together"` (or check https://huggingface.co/settings/inference-providers for which providers are enabled) |
| `402 depleted monthly credits` from HF | Free tier Inference Providers credits used up | Wait for monthly reset, buy pre-paid credits, or upgrade to HF PRO |
| Pinecone `404 Resource not found` | Index name mismatch between `ingest_pdf.py` and `rag.py` | Ensure `INDEX_NAME` is identical in both files |
| `wave.Error: file does not start with RIFF id` | Browser sent webm, backend tried to read it as WAV | Use the Web Audio API WAV recorder (`utils/wavRecorder.js`) instead of `MediaRecorder`, or convert server-side with `pydub` + ffmpeg |
| Booking keeps re-asking for already-given details | Extraction failed to parse and wiped prior state | Already fixed in `booking.py` -- extraction merges into existing details rather than replacing them |